![FRC Kickoff 2021](../../assets/posts/game-changers-2021-first-robotic-competition-season-kicks-off/FRC-kickoff-hero-2021.png)On Saturday, January 9, 2021, for the first-time 50+ team members and mentors of FIRST Robotics Competition Spartronics 4915 attended a virtual kickoff for the start of the 2021 _FIRST_® Robotics Competition season, INFINITE RECHARGE.

From home, Spartronics teammates joined _FIRST®_ faves from around the world, along with FIRST founder [Dean Kamen](https://www.firstinspires.org/about/leadership/dean-kamen), new FIRST president [Larry Cohen](https://www.firstinspires.org/about/leadership/lawrence-cohen), and special guests for the reveal of the _FIRST_ Innovation Challenge presented by Qualcomm, the Game Design Challenge, INFINITE RECHARGE at Home, and other game. The Twitch TV broadcast included all the season details.

Stay tuned for our next update on the game challenges Spartronics will be participating in during our newest season - 2021!
